{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.poster.avif?t=1766057844\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.webm?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/2a2852d09953437c2954e602cc83ecc5.mp4?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, no enemies, no fancy graphics \u2013 just achievements. There are 39 chaotic and unpredictable goals waiting to be unlocked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might find yourself yelling into a microphone, solving strange puzzles, or teaming up with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some achievements are obvious, while others require creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.poster.avif?t=1766057844\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.webm?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/956109171304564270b259bf6c4e0eae.mp4?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for speedrunners and players who love getting 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global leaderboard tracks the fastest and most creative ways to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no single path to victory \u2014 experiment, optimize, and find your own route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.poster.avif?t=1766057844\" width=800 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.webm?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416380/extras/31c04d3a5d43bcf2ae2866a324590339.mp4?t=1766057844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is to unlock all 39 achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will take seconds. Others might take hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your brain, your curiosity, and maybe a bit of teamwork to figure things out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First time?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3416380/7baf67831dc524b82ef4cc4e7d69e8fa6679a893.jpg"},{"name":"It is wednesday, my dudes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3416380/37a50842c97c2877111fc10fcad51dfdc5805be6.jpg"},{"name":"Watch your language","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3416380/36114da6dee1c612e0fbf82980615061207dc0a0.jpg"},{"name":"Random","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3416380/87cb8e44faa0f2b1358d1cbb4d3cf51492f2b4b6.jpg"},{"name":"AFK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3416380/334a7a3c7657499a4d273b7eca169719c388a19e.jpg"},{"name":"Sleep is for the weak","path":"https://cdn.akam